ercing damage."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block-2024__description-block-heading","text":"Bonus Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Shape-Shift."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The werewolf"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover rule-tooltip","text":"shape-shifts"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"into a Large wolf-humanoid hybrid or a Medium wolf, or it returns to its true humanoid form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed."}],"tags":133,"max_dom_depth":7}